OL,3,AAberfan disaster 'most tragic of days
OL,4,Aimaginable' says King on 60th
OL,5,Aanniversary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King has described the Aberfan
OL,8,Fdisaster which killed 116 children and
OL,9,F28 adults as the "most tragic of days
OL,10,Fimaginable" on its 60th anniversary.
OL,12,FPantglas Junior School and a number of
OL,13,Fnearby houses in the village near
OL,14,FMerthyr Tydfil, south Wales, were
OL,15,Fcatastrophically engulfed in coal
OL,16,Fslurry after the colliery spoil tip
OL,17,Fcollapsed on 21 October 1966.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
