OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe PM responded by saying his
OL,8,Fgovernment made a decision the Tories
OL,9,F"messed up" - Jackdaw was approved by
OL,10,Fthe Conservatives in 2022 but a court
OL,11,Flater ruled the consent was granted
OL,12,Funlawfully
OL,14,FThe government says Jackdaw will help
OL,15,Fto "heat millions of homes" and protect
OL,16,F"hundreds of jobs", but Energy
OL,17,FSecretary Miatta Fahnbulleh says it
OL,18,F"won't lower energy bills this winter"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
