OL,3,AJailed former DUP leader Jeffrey
OL,4,ADonaldson being investigated over
OL,5,Aalleged rape inside Parliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FLast week Donaldson was sentenced to 15
OL,8,Fyears in prison for a series of child
OL,9,Fsex offences against two victims,
OL,10,Fincluding one count of rape, which took
OL,11,Fplace between 1985 and 2008. He is
OL,12,Fseeking to appeal his convictions.
OL,14,FIt is understood the woman has been
OL,15,Finterviewed by Police Service of
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) officers.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
